Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.67,0:00:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Run, until we reach{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.99,0:00:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Until we reach you{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.39,0:00:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The clear blue open sea{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.11,0:00:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A sliver of a miracle{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.69,0:00:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We've encountered more\NThan we could ever imagine{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.74,0:00:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With every step we take on this journey{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.39,0:00:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The goal is still out of sight{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.23,0:00:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But we can overcome anything{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.77,0:00:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just to see your smile{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.19,0:00:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If we wavered, we couldn't shine{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.41,0:00:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We even strove to conquer our weaknesses{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.99,0:01:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We, who were truly devoted{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.58,0:01:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Have always been the same{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.50,0:01:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Run{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.63,0:01:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Until we reach\NUntil we reach you, hey{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.18,0:01:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Less than legendary?\NNo problem! It's all good!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.85,0:01:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Until the day we can laugh\NFollow the shining map{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.32,0:01:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, no more hesitation, fighter\NIt's gonna be alright{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.10,0:01:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't just go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.34,0:01:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get lost again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.30,0:01:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I get lost when I have a clear view?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.32,0:01:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.09,0:01:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think was going on\Nwith that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.85,0:02:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The lion turned into a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.10,0:02:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I think a cat turned into a lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.27,0:02:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It was originally a cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.81,0:02:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it was a lion!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.90,0:02:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No, a cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.77,0:02:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,A lion!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.32,0:02:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.78,0:02:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All of those things were massive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.90,0:02:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Are there any more rabbits around?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.97,0:02:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.37,0:02:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.70,0:02:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami-{\i1}san{\i}! Get behind me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.10,0:02:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.66,0:02:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.75,0:02:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"A Quest in the Land of Mystery!\NThe Secret of the Sun God"{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.10,0:03:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.57,0:03:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! How cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.74,0:03:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No bugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.06,0:03:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand big bugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.45,0:03:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a grasshopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.85,0:03:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How does that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.87,0:03:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you guys new around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.56,0:03:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.07,0:03:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.02,0:03:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen our crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.53,0:03:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I try riding it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.03,0:03:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-Crew? They look like this.\N-How much is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.86,0:03:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Too many questions!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.03,0:03:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.89,0:03:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm in a hurry,\Nso I don't have time to sit around and talk, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.27,0:03:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,...all of this vast land\Nbelongs to the Sun God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.17,0:03:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sun God?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.59,0:03:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,God?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.25,0:04:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sun God created this land
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.72,0:04:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and sees everything that happens here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.72,0:04:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! Is he strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.27,0:04:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! He's a god!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.91,0:04:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Yggdrasil, the World Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.83,0:04:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sun God created this land\Nwith Yggdrasil at its heart
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.02,0:04:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,and dispatched countless gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.17,0:04:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,One might call this the Land of Gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.30,0:04:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,All the people of this land\Nhold the gods in awe and reverence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.33,0:04:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.91,0:04:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's the faith of this land,\Nwe must respect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.66,0:04:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You should follow local customs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.29,0:04:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I serve the ruler of this Bigstein Castle\Nand one of the gods,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.76,0:04:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Iscat-{\i1}sama{\i}!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.82,0:04:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If you so desire,\Nyou may one day be granted an audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.27,0:04:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Is there a person in that castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.06,0:04:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.79,0:05:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, the cat has just...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.26,0:05:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.67,0:05:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Needle God the hedgehog\Nis likely feeling famished by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.43,0:05:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hedgehog?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.98,0:05:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ear God the giant rabbit\Nperished in a fire near the town,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.25,0:05:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and it has delayed me a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.42,0:05:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We at--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.99,0:05:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What a terrible tragedy that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.45,0:05:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If you guys are hungry,\Nyou should go into town to get your Fodder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.27,0:05:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Fodder?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.65,0:05:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That means food.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,As a precaution, I must tell you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.42,0:05:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You must never go any further\Nbeyond the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.41,0:05:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.26,0:05:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There stands the Sun God's temple,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.06,0:05:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,guarded by vicious soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.79,0:06:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No one who approached it\Nhas ever returned alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.53,0:06:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't say it like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.32,0:06:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.12,0:06:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That fool...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.98,0:06:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, old man,\Nthanks for everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.92,0:06:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.25,0:06:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,...sorry for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.88,0:06:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.55,0:06:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Vicious soldiers, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.49,0:06:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy's like that because you're like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.79,0:06:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be ashamed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.31,0:06:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.15,0:06:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! The castle is crumbling?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.49,0:06:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I smell an adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.82,0:06:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Vicious soldiers?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.60,0:06:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Gods?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.35,0:06:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourselves already!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.44,0:06:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.65,0:07:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Luffy! Think about Nami-{\i1}san{\i}!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.15,0:07:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use, Sanji-{\i1}kun{\i}.\NThere's no stopping Luffy when he gets going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.11,0:07:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no houses around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.34,0:07:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this road ever end?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.00,0:07:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.83,0:07:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't the shape identical\Nto the one we just saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.13,0:07:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.03,0:07:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's running this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.36,0:07:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He's wearing an Elbaph outfit, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.41,0:07:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares. Let's avoid him and move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.87,0:07:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.56,0:07:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.02,0:07:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.76,0:07:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.03,0:07:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The sky cracked?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.39,0:07:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.50,0:08:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What the... How's this possible?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.36,0:08:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! The sky over the temple cracked!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.84,0:08:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait... The other side, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.15,0:08:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.68,0:08:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So much is happening in the kingdom today!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.17,0:08:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.96,0:08:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...is broken...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.05,0:08:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain! It's a curse!\NDivine retribution!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.45,0:08:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The hedgehog and the cat that we took down\Nwere gods, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.03,0:08:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We must have incurred their wrath!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.37,0:08:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Look closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.37,0:08:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.50,0:09:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.92,0:09:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is clearly a room for a Giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.66,0:09:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way\Nthis is inside the Elbaph ship, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.91,0:09:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I didn't see a room like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.37,0:09:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, what is this metal fence?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.79,0:09:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If there is a Giant on the other side...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.81,0:09:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,we are like pets\Nthat are kept in a spacious cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.36,0:09:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.25,0:09:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.19,0:09:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.38,0:09:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Is someone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.18,0:10:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.13,0:10:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is so high!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.16,0:10:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.97,0:10:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.50,0:10:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.02,0:10:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.90,0:11:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.35,0:11:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys! It's great to see you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that collar?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.71,0:11:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know! It was there when I woke up\Nand I was here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.57,0:11:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't get it off\Nbecause the iron of the collar is too tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.55,0:11:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I was gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.62,0:11:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.05,0:11:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cut it off for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.20,0:11:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're scaring me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.27,0:11:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A lock like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.52,0:11:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,...is a piece of cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.63,0:11:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! You aren't called\Nthe Cat Burglar for nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.90,0:11:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.93,0:11:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, poor Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.18,0:11:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.89,0:11:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You owe me one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.35,0:11:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.27,0:11:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You were crying earlier, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.31,0:11:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.50,0:11:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,In a room for a Giant...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.92,0:11:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,there are human-sized clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.34,0:12:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we being treated like dress-up dolls?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.91,0:12:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But to think a Giant crafted these...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.62,0:12:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,it makes you wonder if the Sun God\Nis actually meticulous and good with his hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.40,0:12:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.99,0:12:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.80,0:12:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There are a bunch of toy blocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.45,0:12:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.77,0:12:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole land is made of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.37,0:12:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,When you grilled the rabbit,\Nit smelled so bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.77,0:12:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,...because some synthetic resin\Ngot burned as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.77,0:12:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And the sky you ran into...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.51,0:12:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It seemed like the road was endless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.93,0:12:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that was just a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.66,0:12:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,A mirror?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.30,0:12:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So that guy was me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.21,0:12:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.98,0:12:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.81,0:12:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can see through it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.55,0:13:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like\Njust a sheet of glass from this side.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.82,0:13:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know\Nsuch a magical mirror existed...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.12,0:13:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami-{\i1}san{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.79,0:13:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I clean the girls' room...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.42,0:13:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even think about installing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.67,0:13:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So some sick Giant built Block Kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.98,0:13:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,tossed humans and animals in,\Nand just watched them for fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.57,0:13:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What a creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.55,0:13:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But that means we're in Elbaph already?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.20,0:13:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a Giant's house\Nin the Giants' kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.27,0:13:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought so!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.35,0:13:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.44,0:13:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Not necessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.61,0:13:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing we know for sure\Nis this is a Giant's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.64,0:13:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to go outside to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.68,0:13:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are the others?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.31,0:13:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here\Nbefore the Giant returns!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.48,0:13:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we better head back to town\Nand gather information.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.04,0:14:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Just in case, no matter how weird this Giant is,\Nlet's avoid any trouble with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.01,0:14:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.09,0:14:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's stop causing a scene...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.51,0:14:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I just kick this one's ass?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.22,0:14:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, kick it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.81,0:14:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Look down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.71,0:14:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.17,0:14:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.82,0:14:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Whoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.72,0:14:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No! They're climbing up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.66,0:14:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a crow, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.58,0:14:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the soldiers of the temple?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.42,0:14:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So they're the reason\Nno one has ever returned alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.48,0:14:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How is this a temple?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.07,0:14:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You already ate a rabbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.76,0:14:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So take down the rest of the animals!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.96,0:15:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish them with one blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.69,0:15:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Sun God returns...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.67,0:15:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.06,0:15:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Gear Five...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.16,0:16:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a minute, you damn mice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.97,0:16:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I said...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.43,0:16:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,...wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.69,0:17:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper! Can we get up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.74,0:17:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay! Is there something there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.74,0:17:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I smell treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.30,0:17:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.56,0:17:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hot! Who did this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.76,0:17:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy! You're going too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.67,0:17:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't spread the fire from the fireplace!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.09,0:17:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.29,0:18:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.88,0:18:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the Sun God?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.59,0:18:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My temple...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.31,0:18:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.58,0:18:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sun God has returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.00,0:18:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.81,0:18:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.48,0:18:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be with you in a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.94,0:18:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll finish this up, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.12,0:18:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Muginn!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.38,0:18:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.59,0:18:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...Dawn...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.76,0:19:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,...Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.98,0:19:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hilmungardr!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.02,0:19:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.31,0:19:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.59,0:19:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.80,0:19:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.61,0:19:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.56,0:19:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.03,0:19:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.01,0:19:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Unforgivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.88,0:19:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That Giant is pretty big!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.78,0:19:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he looks creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.64,0:19:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.79,0:20:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.85,0:20:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He said, "I won't forget this!"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.98,0:20:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.42,0:20:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.69,0:20:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't find anything of value, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.17,0:20:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a blueprint for Block Kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.62,0:20:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's a map?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.45,0:20:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.35,0:20:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.97,0:20:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my Nami-{\i1}san{\i}!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.66,0:20:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.23,0:20:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.65,0:20:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you ruin my kingdom?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.24,0:20:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.66,0:20:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Go through the barrens, past the castle,\Nand run straight. Then we'll hit another mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.89,0:20:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If we smash through it and the whole wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.36,0:20:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,we can get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.51,0:21:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.72,0:21:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.97,0:21:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The ground is shaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.43,0:21:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sun God...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.67,0:21:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,...is angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.23,0:21:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.12,0:21:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Here I am straining both my eyes{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.54,0:21:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And checking where I am standing right now{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.76,0:21:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With my brain consumed\NBy all the delusion and despair{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.33,0:21:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm always bound to be a little off somehow{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.22,0:21:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The things that come up vividly{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.40,0:22:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are always the cruel memories{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.78,0:22:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I gather up the scraps\NOf the simple boredom of my life{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.22,0:22:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I might turn into somebody else but me{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.37,0:22:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wonder which future\NWould fit someone like me now{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.48,0:22:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}From here on\NNo matter how hard I try to strain my eyes{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.40,0:22:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll still see nothing anyhow{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.86,0:22:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm riding the headwind{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.32,0:22:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I pour it into the tear of destiny{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.20,0:22:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As I split all the false fantasies apart{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.66,0:22:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And everyone's{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.21,0:22:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Piling up their own life-or-death reality\NAll the time just like that{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.75,0:22:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then tomorrow comes way too loud{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.34,0:22:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Leaving no time even just to pray{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.88,0:22:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And that future we see{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.72,0:22:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It all belongs to me{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.88,0:23:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The ultimate game of tag erupts\Nin Block Kingdom.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.13,0:23:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Sun God hunts Luffy and the others,\Nbut what is his mysterious true identity?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.20,0:23:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As the battle heats up,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.50,0:23:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}a single strike from Luffy\Ncarves out a path to a brand-new adventure.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.13,0:23:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,On the next episode of ONE PIECE!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.50,0:23:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,"Destroy the Miniature Garden -\NEscape Block Kingdom!"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.67,0:00:14.99,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kakero todoku made{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.99,0:00:19.31,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kimi ni todoku made{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.39,0:00:27.56,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}aoku sunda unabara{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.11,0:00:30.90,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kiseki no kakera{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.69,0:00:37.20,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kazoekirenai hodo deaeta ne{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.74,0:00:40.39,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}susumu tabi susumu tabi{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.39,0:00:44.23,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}goru wa mada mienai mama{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.23,0:00:47.77,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}demo nandatte koerareru yo{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.77,0:00:51.19,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}sono egao mitai kara{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.19,0:00:55.41,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}mayoeba hikari ni nareya shinakatta{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.41,0:00:58.99,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}yowasa mo chanto tagayashita{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.99,0:01:04.58,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}hontou honki de ita bokura mada{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.58,0:01:08.50,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kawaranai yo{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.50,0:01:09.63,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kakero{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.63,0:01:17.18,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}todoku made kimi ni todoku made nee{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.18,0:01:23.85,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}densetsu miman datte joutou joutou{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.85,0:01:30.32,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kirameku chizu itsuka waraeru hi made{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.32,0:01:36.51,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}mou mayoi wa nainda Fighter daijoubu{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.12,0:21:37.79,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kenmei ni me wo korashite{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.54,0:21:43.30,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}genzaichi wo tashikameteiru{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.76,0:21:49.33,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}mousou to zetsubou ni nareta noumiso dewa{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.33,0:21:52.60,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}doushitatte chotto zurechimau ya{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.22,0:21:57.02,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}senmei ni ukandekuru no wa{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.40,0:22:02.07,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}itsudatte hidoi omoide de{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.78,0:22:08.22,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kantan na taikutsu wo hiroiatsumete wa{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.22,0:22:11.78,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}dareka mitai ni nacchimaisou{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.37,0:22:16.48,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}ore ni niau mirai wa doredarou{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.48,0:22:20.40,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}koko kara jaa ikura me wo korashitemo{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.40,0:22:22.86,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}nanimo mie wa shinai sa{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.86,0:22:26.32,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}gyakufuu ni nokkatte{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.32,0:22:29.20,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}machigatta kuusou wo{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.20,0:22:33.66,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kirisaita unmei no sakeme ni nagashikomu{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.66,0:22:37.21,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}daremo ga sou yatte{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.21,0:22:41.75,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}inochigake no genjitsu wo kasaneteirunda{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.75,0:22:44.34,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}negau hima mo nai hodo{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.34,0:22:48.88,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}sawagashii ashita ga kuru{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.88,0:22:53.72,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}sono mirai wa hora{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.72,0:22:57.87,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}ore no mon da yo{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.01,0:23:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be King of the Pirates!

